# minimize t over (t, x - 3 s, y - 4 s) in Q3 with s = 1 and x <= 0: the
# nearest point of the half-plane x <= 0 to (3, 4) is (0, 4), so t = 3.
# The cone is over affine expressions, so the reader adds three columns.
VER
3

OBJSENSE
MIN

VAR
4 3
F 1
L- 1
F 2

CON
4 2
L= 1
Q 3

OBJACOORD
1
0 1

ACOORD
6
0 3 1
1 0 1
2 1 1
2 3 -3
3 2 1
3 3 -4

BCOORD
1
0 -1
